    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Morning routine",
     "texto": [
      "**Bangun** means to wake up, **mandi** means to bathe, and **sarapan** means to have breakfast. The verbs do not change according to the person."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Before, after and then",
     "texto": [
      "**Sebelum** means \"before\", **setelah**, \"after\", and **lalu**, \"then\". The order of the sentence can vary."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Telling the time",
     "texto": [
      "**Pukul lima pagi** is the same as \"at five in the morning\". **Jam** is also used when telling the time."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
